(Tbong Khmum): On the morning of September 05, 2022, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum, led by Deputy Provincial Governor, Provincial Hall, relevant departments and units around the province and local authorities inspected and immediately repaired. The building of Kbal Boeung Ses Primary School, which was blown away by the wind, is located in Kbal Boeung Ses Village, Kor Commune, Tbong Khmum District, Tbong Khmum Province.
