Mr. Hem Sina has been announced as the new Governor of Romduol District, Svay Rieng Provincial Governor.
(Svay Rieng): Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng Province, this morning, September 05, 2022, announced the inauguration of the Governor of Romduol District by Mr. Hem Sina as the new Governor of Romduol District, replacing Mr. Sokharam as the new Deputy Governor. Svay Rieng Province.
The announcement ceremony was also attended by Mr. and Mrs. Deputy Chiefs of Departments around the province, civil servants, district halls and offices around the district, commune chiefs, commune clerks and chiefs of 10 administrative police stations, representatives of civil society organizations operating in Romduol district. And many other relevant officials as well.
The provincial governor instructed some important tasks such as:
* First, to continue to encourage people to participate in the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes and increase cooperation among relevant authorities and authorities in maintaining peace, political stability, security, public order, prevention and suppression of crimes. In particular, drug offenses, human trafficking, theft and gambling in all localities throughout the district must continue to take strict and strict enforcement of traffic laws.
* Second, the district administration must continue to focus on leading the implementation of measures to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease and encourage more active vaccination, both at the basic and booster doses. 4 and 5).
* Third: The district administration must disseminate, guide and encourage the people in its locality to check the list and register to vote for everyone, according to the calendar of the NEC must start from October 20. Until December 08, 2022.
* Fourth: To cooperate to strengthen the unity and internal unity and strengthen the working system, good labor relations in the district council, district governors, civil servants and all kinds of law enforcement forces to avoid conflicts of interest and conflict. Which arises from the misuse of power.
* Fifth, the district board of governors must prepare a clear division of roles, duties and responsibilities within the district board of governors in accordance with the guidelines of the Ministry of Interior.
* Sixth, the District Board of Governors must pay attention to strengthening the management of the presence and performance of civil servants in the district administrative structure, and must prepare and implement working conditions for civil servants so that all officials have jobs. Everyone, along with strengthening the management and capacity building of civil servants to be ready to receive the transfer of functions from ministries and institutions at the national level in the future.
8th: At present, although the district has not yet prepared for the official inauguration, the OWSO is already in the process of providing administrative services to the people, so efforts must be made to strengthen the implementation of this work. Good work to improve the provision of administrative services to the people to be more effective with good governance in accordance with the procedures and procedures for providing services in a new structure and function.
