Through the 10 years of export experience of the rice sector, he noted that these two markets are very potential markets for Cambodia, which can promote exports quickly and without wasting time. The Chinese market has absorbed a lot of white and fragrant rice from Cambodia and the European market has absorbed more than 90% of Cambodia's fragrant rice.
"I think this is a model for you in the agro-food sector, there are only two markets that we have to try to capture: China and Europe are possible, otherwise we are still complicated, so the preparation," he said. "Investment must be clear about history."
