Speaking in a press conference after the handover ceremony of 150 vehicles, a grant from the Chinese Ministry of National Defense to the Ministry of National Defense of Cambodia at the Victory Monument this morning, September 1, 2022, the Minister of National Defense of Cambodia. Regrets the continued accusations against Cambodia that it allowed China to set up military bases in the country.
Samdech Pichey Sena reiterated that Cambodia has sufficient rights to modernize in the Ream Sea base, while some countries have repeatedly accused it of being malicious.
"The modernization of the Ream Sea is only to increase the capacity of the Cambodian navy, and the accusation that this place is for Chinese military bases is inciting trouble for Cambodia," he said. "While the Royal Government of Cambodia has repeatedly explained, they do not listen because their eyes are still good but blind."
In recent years, the United States has repeatedly accused Cambodia, without clear evidence, of allowing China to set up a military base in the country at Ream Naval Base as the area was modernized. However, the Royal Government of Cambodia has denied all allegations and stated that the Cambodian Constitution does not allow the presence of foreign troops on its territory.
Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh added that the construction of the Ream Sea base is to protect Cambodia's sovereignty, Cambodia's territorial integrity, increase the capacity of the Cambodian army, while the construction project has been ready for a long time, but has been active recently. But the need.
The Cambodian Minister of Defense stated that the arbitrary accusations of these people, without listening to the explanations of the Royal Government of Cambodia often, they want nothing to interfere in the internal affairs of Cambodia.
The commitment was made when Ms. UIKU Kocaefe, Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of the Republic of Turkey to the Kingdom of Cambodia, paid a courtesy call on Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, Acting Head of State of the Kingdom of Cambodia on 1 September. This 2022 at the Senate.
The Ambassador expressed satisfaction and appreciation for the good relations and cooperation between the two countries in the fields of politics, trade, investment and education. The Ambassador informed the Acting Head of State that the Turkish Parliament had formed a friendship group between the two countries.
She believes that there will be an exchange of high-level delegations between the two countries' parliaments to promote mutual understanding and deepen relations and cooperation between the two countries. At the same time, she praised the importance of Cambodia in Asia.
The Ambassador congratulated Cambodia on its rotating ASEAN chairmanship, a difficult phase in addressing regional and global issues. However, Cambodia has successfully played this important role.
The Acting Head of State recalled the diplomatic relations between the two countries established in 1959 and the official opening of the Cambodian Embassy in the Republic of Turkey in February 2022. Through the diplomatic relations of the two countries, Samdech expressed his satisfaction and appreciation for the good friendship and cooperation between the people of the two countries, which has been constantly developing.
The Acting Head of State emphasized that the Senate, National Assembly, Royal Government, Ministries, National Institutions of the Kingdom of Cambodia are always ready to cooperate closely with Her Excellency as well as the Turkish Embassy to contribute to the strengthening of friendship and cooperation. Mutual benefit to the people and the two countries.
Taking this opportunity, through the Ambassador, the Acting Head of State brought a royal message to pay tribute to His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia and Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk and class. Leading the National Supreme Leader of the Kingdom of Cambodia to His Excellency the President, the Supreme Leaders of all levels of the Republic of Turkey.
Once again, the Acting Head of State wished the Ambassador good health and success in this noble diplomatic mission.
