The leaders of the Khmer Patriotic Party in Banteay Meanchey who participated in the political life with the CPP include: Ms. Rin Phally, Chairman of the Provincial Party Committee, Mr. Chhum Sam Bun, Chairman of the Serey Sophorn Municipal Party Committee, Mr. Soeun Saroeum Svay Chek District Party Committee and Mr. Un Sary, Chairman of O'Chrov District Party Committee.
