Rin Phally said she and her team spent a lot of time serving the opposition in Banteay Meanchey because of misunderstandings about the CPP. In particular, I believe in the leaders of the opposition who always claim to be given various roles and positions.
"I now see and clearly understand the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party, headed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which seeks peace, national unity and development of the country. I would like to join the CPP and work hard to contribute to serving the motherland. This is the confirmation of Ms. Rin Phally.
