In this tripartite meeting, the Royal Government side also continued to coordinate and provide additional explanations on various points at the request of the workers 'representatives and the employers' representatives. According to the technical specifications and data changes of the seven criteria, which are the basis for determining the minimum wage, the General Secretariat of the National Minimum Wage Council has calculated that the minimum wage figure for 2023 is 197.86 US dollars.
