He said that so far, 41 refresher courses have been opened and more than 7,000 private security agents have passed. In that, we surveyed that the private security agents who passed this course, which is a private security agency full of full capacity, have high awareness and good ethics.
Lt. Gen. Lim Sokharasmey emphasized that private security agencies have a role not only in protecting private property or private enterprises, but also in their duty to protect public property, social security and the lives of the people, in particular. Role as an important support force to the competent authorities.
If a private security agency sees or suspects any illegal activity, it must immediately report it to the competent authority, or in case of actual crime, the private security agency also has the right to assist as an auxiliary force in assisting to detain the perpetrator and must immediately report to the authorities. Have the authority to hand over the person to the authorities to deal with according to the law.
