(Oddar Meanchey): Mr. Robin Nai, Member of the National Committee Against Torture, on August 31, 2022, led a professional officer to inspect the prisons, prisons and other detention centers in Oddar Meanchey Province to carry out the duties and responsibilities assigned by the Royal Government. To the National Committee against Torture.
During the inspection, he met and discussed with the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Administrative Unity Command about the role and duties of the National Committee against Torture and Torture Prevention Measures.
