(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Women's Affairs has issued a press release expressing its deep regret and condemnation of the pageant in an overly sexy, sexually explicit image, seriously undermining the honor, dignity and value of the pageant. Khmer women. This is according to a press release obtained by Fresh News on August 31.
