(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Japan, through its Embassy in Cambodia, has donated US $ 263,760 to Krouch Chhmar District Referral Hospital to purchase 17 types of medical equipment to strengthen the hospital's capacity and improve the quality of public health care services. To the patient. This is according to the release on the official Facebook page of the Embassy of Japan on August 31, 2022.
