During the meeting, Minister Pan Sosak extended a warm welcome to the delegation and colleagues who visited the Ministry of Commerce and thanked the United States Government for providing anti-Kovid-19 vaccine to Cambodia. More than 3 million doses, which is an important contribution to the reopening of Cambodia's economic and social activities.
Mr. Pan Sorsak also informed about the successful progress of the organization of the ASEAN Meeting, which Cambodia is chairing and related meetings, especially the preparations for the upcoming 54th ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting in Siem Reap. In addition, the Minister also mentioned the volume of Cambodia-US trade, which has increased significantly despite the Kovit-19 crisis.
