At the same time, the Ministry of Interior also issued Instruction No. 015 Sorn, dated July 1, 2019, on the issuance of administrative letters and civil status documents to Cambodian spouses, children and immigrant aliens. Permanent residence permit issued by the Ministry to immigrant foreigners as well.
