* Environmental issues are more stressful than ever. Solving environmental problems requires the participation of all and in the right way. At Cambrew, we are moving towards "no carbon emissions" at our breweries.
* Water is an important ingredient in the production of our beer and beverages. And water will become an increasingly valuable resource. Therefore, we have a responsibility to ensure that we are using water sparingly and efficiently in our business operations, we are involved in protecting water resources and public water sources, and we are giving back to the community. "Clean water equals the amount of water we use in our production line."
