The grandparents of the two former village chiefs, a couple, called for help as they got older and became seriously ill and helpless
(Kampong Chhnang): The difficult life of two grandparents, a couple who are both former village chiefs, both husband and wife living in Thmey village, Chrey Bak commune, Rolea Bier district, Kampong Chhnang province, raised their hands to call for help from the authorities and philanthropists. He grew old and became very ill and helpless.
Currently, the two former village chiefs, a couple, have a terminal illness that makes it very difficult for them to live because they have no children. Not only that, they also have the responsibility of raising a young granddaughter, whose parents have been adopted by their grandparents from an early age, and their parents have never left to visit or send money to raise children or visit. No children.
