Recently, the spokesman of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, Mr. Ros Sovacha, confirmed that the Ministry does not ban the use of mobile phones or technology that supports student learning and teacher teaching, because in the context of the crisis 19, the use of modern equipment. This is an important aid in student distance learning.
However, if a student uses a cell phone to misbehave in school, to the detriment of his or her education and social dignity, such as playing games, watching pornography, filming videos or taking inappropriate pictures, or using social media too often, the group Each school disciplinary advisor may impose fines according to the degree of error or provide education to correct the mistake.
However, the American Intercontinental School of Duke Dr. Kouch Mengly managed to prevent students and staff from using the phone differently from their learning and teaching goals.
Founder, Chairman and CEO of Mengly JSC. Kouch Education stated, "My school has been operating since 2006 to ban the use of telephones because of the rich children of that generation and the use of telephones to interfere with learning." So I issued a law forbidding the use of cell phones in the classroom, not even the alarm clock in the classroom, and not to pick up the phone in the classroom. If there is one on my side, I will keep it for a month and take it back. ”
In the institution of Duke Kouch Mengly, there is a program to capture pornographic websites that help when students and staff connect to the site can not be opened and 100% effective. He claims that even playing games is not possible without the permission to use educational games.
On October 22, 2009, the Ministry of Education has already issued a Proclamation on Internal Rules for Public Secondary Education Institutions, which aims to organize public higher education institutions to be safe, secure, orderly, disciplined and ethically sound. The goal is to improve the quality and efficiency of education.
Mr. ROS Sovacha emphasized that "Students who violate the internal regulations of the educational institution must be submitted to the disciplinary council for review and decision on the level of error under the guise of reprimand in the written notice of the suspension. Temporary study, remove the name from the study list or send to the relevant authorities.
Westline School also regularly monitors classroom irregularities, including cell phones and computers, for fear that students will deviate from the Department of Education's guidelines.
According to Duke Pech Bolen, the use of digital devices for study could not be prevented, but only for students to use, to educate them and to monitor their use of those devices for the benefit of study and personal development.
Nuon Pheakdey, deputy director general of the ASEAN Heritage School, said that his school had also strictly followed the Ministry of Education, and that when the ministry issued a new warning, only schools would tighten their grip. He said that the school has just reduced the use of mobile phones due to the context of Kovid 19, which requires students to use technology to help in learning.
According to Mr. Nuon Pheakdey, when the students of ASEAN Heritage School entered the campus, the school confiscated their phones and left them at the teacher's place.
Please be informed that according to the Ministry of Education, the Ministry does not prohibit the use of mobile phones or technology that supports learning and teaching, especially in the context of Kovid 19, where learning and teaching must continue to follow the new normal path of education. Digital education plays an even more important role, so students need to learn the positive benefits of using mobile phones and technology.
