Dr. Cheam Yeap: Cambodia will work closely with China's great friend on global development and global security initiatives
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Cheam Yeap, First Vice President of the National Assembly of Cambodia, stated that Cambodia will closely cooperate with its Chinese allies on global development and global security initiatives. From China's plan to promote the establishment of a more just and reasonable global governance system in the sense of safeguarding peace, prosperity and development in the region.
This morning, on August 26, 2022, during a bilateral meeting with Mr. Wang Chen, Vice Chairman of the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress of the People's Republic of China. By virtual system.
At the same time, Dr. Cheam Yeap also highly appreciated and highly appreciated the organization of this meeting organized by the Chinese People's Congress in order to strengthen solidarity and cooperation as well as exchange views. As a great friend of China, a strategic partner in all aspects and a steel friend of Cambodia.
Mr. Wang Chin also mentioned the good relations that have been built from the previous generation of leaders and continue to strengthen up to the current leaders of the two countries, China and Cambodia, and that both sides can promote the implementation of the belt plan. And officially modernize the digital economy, provide vaccines, and China will provide experience in vaccine production to the Cambodian side.
He also mentioned the cultural exchanges between journalists and think tanks of the two countries. China and Cambodia adhere to the same multilateral concept of maintaining world peace and based on international law, which is based on the United Nations. Both China and Cambodia are truly communities with a common destiny. He also expressed his appreciation for Cambodia for standing firm in supporting China in maintaining its territorial integrity.
Mr. Vong Chhin added that Cambodia has become more open in economic development, exchange of experiences to achieve the modernization of its production, in line with the vision of Samdech Techo Prime Minister to lead Cambodia to a middle-income country. 2030 and high income in 2050.
He also spoke of his firm adherence to the one-China policy and the one-China policy. The governments and peoples of the two countries have always shared their condolences during the difficult period of the outbreak of Kovid-19, in which the Chinese ally has provided 42 million doses of Kovid-19 vaccine to Cambodia. Become the country that supplies the most important and safest vaccine in Cambodia.
The First Vice President of the National Assembly also said that Samdech Techo Prime Minister of Cambodia and senior leaders of the People's Republic of China have made diplomatic relations between our two countries, Cambodia and China, so far become a steel relationship. Tape that bears beautiful fruit and brings progress and prosperity to our nation on both sides.
Dr. Cheam Yeap also thanked the Chinese Communist Party and the Chinese people for taking care of the health of His Majesty the King, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia and Samdech Preah. Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, the Queen Mother of Cambodia, has always supported the Cambodian people from the past to the present.
