(Takeo): Honorary General Hing Bun Heang, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and Commander of Samdech Techo Bodyguard Command, said that as of August 26, 2022, the replanting of trees in Phnom Tamao has been completed. 88% and are currently rushing to dig the reservoir quickly in response to the high order of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
