(Kandal): The Kandal Provincial Administration has held a ceremony to announce the appointment of the new Governor of Takhmao City, Mr. Khim Samphear, former Deputy Governor of Khsach Kandal District, to replace Mr. Nou Sovannara, who will return to work at Kandal Provincial Hall.
