The rapid reopening of borders has not only boosted tourism, but also allowed investors to come back, leading to an increase in FDI this year.
The sky of Phnom Penh is a testament to the economic progress that Cambodia has made in recent years. Effective prevention of Kovid 19 will bring the country closer to achieving its goal of becoming a high-middle-income country by 2030.
