At the same time, many summer crops such as corn, soybeans and sunflowers are projected to reduce yields by 12-16% compared to the average yield of the past five years. The capacity of hydropower generation is also affected. The problem of low water level has caused obstruction to the traffic on the river.
Droughts, combined with heat waves, have created unprecedented pressure on water levels across the EU, and many European countries have experienced more wildfires than ever before.
