* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the victory over Kovid 19 enabled Cambodia to reschedule regional and international meetings in early August.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended all the students who worked hard to study during the difficult phase of the Kovid 19 epidemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are many opportunities for Cambodian youth today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in this era, young people have a lot of opportunities compared to young people in the war era who completely lost the opportunity for study.
