* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that education in Cambodia does not depend on his insults, but on efforts to strengthen education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government recognizes the weaknesses and needs to make improvements that the Ministry of Education has worked hard.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government recognizes the weaknesses in education that need to be improved and the Ministry of Education has made great efforts to improve education.
