* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the doctors were too tired during the epidemic stage of Kovid 19 disease.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the salaries of teachers and doctors are the highest.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to study the number of civil servants in Sri Lanka, which is about 1.5 million. This number, Samdech Techo mentioned that could be a problem for Sri Lanka to face a crisis.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the selection of civil servants can not always be selected, there must be a clear examination.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that even though Samdech lost his power, the control of power was always under the control of the Cambodian People's Party.
