* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the offensive media must have their licenses revoked.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the opening of Vietnamese language classes at the Royal School of Phnom Penh is beneficial for Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the opening of Vietnamese language classes to facilitate students to study in Vietnam facilitates doing business and performing other tasks.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Mr. Hun Manet's visit to Vietnam was less organized than the visit to Japan and Singapore.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed regret that analysts did not mention Hun Manet's visit to Japan.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the war in Cambodia would erupt if the CPP was not in power. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are two points that will lead to the explosion, including: the use of the word ready to seize from the rich to the poor and ready to take the lost land.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the opposition that if Chet Soeung in the political program during the election announced to take Vietnam when he won the election.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen explains the protocol of using the flag when welcoming foreign guests. Samdech Techo confirmed that when the King received foreign guests, he never hoisted the national flag of the guests. The receptionist never raised the flag of the guest country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told analysts that if they are ignorant, they should learn more.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen states that the Prime Ministerial candidate in Cambodia does not need the support of any country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen: War in Cambodia will erupt if the opposition party leads because of the policy of confiscating the property of the rich to the poor and taking the lost land
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells the story of educating that unsatisfactory greed leads to disaster.
* Based on the experience of Sri Lanka, Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised not to overstate government employees, as the spending policy is limited to 4%.
