Interior Ministry spokesman: 33 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on 21 August
(Phnom Penh): At least 33 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on August 21, 2022 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on August 22.
