(Preah Vihear): The continuous rain these days has flooded some houses of people living along the border at the foot of Dangrek mountain in Choam Ksan district, Preah Vihear province. On August 21, 2022, nearly 100 troops from the 7th Intervention Brigade under the 3rd Intervention Brigade, along with various relief items, went to help the people whose houses were flooded.
