Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends Message to the President of the Philippines Congratulations on the 65th Anniversary of the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, sends a message to Ferdinand Romeldes Marcos Jr. The President of the Republic of the Philippines congratulates and wishes on the occasion of the 65th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between the two countries on August 20, 2022.
In a message received by Fresh News, Hun Sen said: "Cambodia and the Philippines have enjoyed close relations and close cooperation in many fields over the past six and a half decades. "I am pleased to see the progress of our relationship, which has been enhanced by the exchange of visits between the leaders of the two countries and people-to-people contacts."
He added that the celebration of the 65th anniversary of our diplomatic relations is an opportune time to reaffirm our commitment to work closely together for the development of close relations and to expand cooperation between Cambodia and the Philippines. In the common interest of our two peoples, we aim to contribute to the peace, stability, sustainable development and prosperity of the ASEAN Community and the world.
The Prime Minister also invited the President of the Philippines to pay an official visit to the Kingdom of Cambodia during this significant year.
In a message received by Fresh News, the King stated: "On the occasion of the 65th Anniversary of the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Republic of the Philippines (20 August 1957-20) August 2022) I have the pleasure to express my warm congratulations and best wishes to His Excellency and the people of the Philippines for good health, happiness and success.
The King noted that over the past 65 years, Cambodia-Philippines has enjoyed long-term relations and cooperation in many fields, which has brought benefits as people-to-people contacts continue. Progress despite the impact of regional and global challenges.
He firmly believes that under the wise leadership of His Excellency, the friendly relations and close cooperation between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Republic of the Philippines will continue to grow in the years to come.
