This statement was made by Prof. Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, at the opening ceremony of the first workshop of Ang Duong Hospital on Modern Nursing Care "Innovation in Nursing Care Management, Leadership and Patient Safety ”held at the Le Royal Hotel Phnom Penh on August 20, 2022.
