Dr. Keo Sophan continued that registration as a member of the Medical Council is important and it is the duty of the doctor, because if you are a health care provider, but without a license, there will be criminal penalties.
As of August 18, 2022, a total of 296 registered members of the Kampot-Kep Medical Council have applied for a total of 250 licenses, of which 242 have been licensed and 8 have not yet applied for a license. 40 people and 6 people are not fit to apply for a license (4 people died).
