Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng leaks that an undersecretary of state has been fired for promising to "sell the framework" (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, has revealed that An Undersecretary of State has been fired for corruption, promising to offer officials in exchange for money from those seeking to join the Ministry of Interior.
