Mentioning this, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng also broke the case of an official at the level of Undersecretary of State in the Ministry of Interior who ran the sale of this official post, and finally asked Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, to end his position. .
Samdech Krala Hom added, "This is something we have to cut. If not, promise to sell the framework. Ah, no. "We are reforming the police to be able to effectively and effectively serve the people."
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng did not reveal the identity of the official who was fired because of this corruption. However, on August 6, 2022, the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, issued a Royal Decree terminating the position of Mr. Chea Bunheng from Undersecretary of State at the Ministry of Interior.
Although Sar Kheng did not confirm the identity of the corrupt official, it was concluded that he was Chea Bunheng.
