(Kratie): The Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Kratie Province on August 18, 2022 held a ceremony to release 40,000 juvenile fish and seedlings into a natural lake called Boeung Sluel in Kampi village, Sambok commune. Chit Borey district to celebrate National Fish Day on July 1.
The ceremony was presided over by Mr. Pen Linath, Deputy Governor, with more than 200 community fishermen.
He said that the lake is about 32 hectares and has a conservation area of 2.5 hectares, with water in both the dry and wet seasons. The fishing community was established in 2009 with a total of 207 community members. 154 families will be officially registered by Prakas No. 628 PRK in 2011 of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries.
