Mr. Im Chhun Lim Leads a Delegation to the 5th Congress of the Asian Constitutional Court Association and Similar Institutions via Video
(Phnom Penh): Dr. M. Chhun Lim, President of the Constitutional Council, on the afternoon of August 18, 2022, led a delegation of the Constitutional Council to attend the 5th Congress of the Asian Constitutional Court and AACC (AACC) via online video. (Zoom) under the theme "Recent Developments of Constitutional Justice in Asia".
The Asian Constitutional Court Association and its affiliates (AACC) is the Asian Regional Forum for Constitutional Justice, established in July 2010 to promote the development of democracy, the rule of law and fundamental rights in Asia through Exchanging information and experiences related to constitutional justice and promoting cooperation and friendship between institutions implementing constitutional jurisdiction.
In addition, the AACC has established cooperation among its members in the form of conferences and international conferences, short courses and human resource exchanges.
