"We recognize Cambodia's strong economic potential and are confident that the economic reforms implemented by the Royal Government of Cambodia, together with the mitigation of the global pandemic of Code-15, will attract more Spanish companies," she said. To invest in Cambodia and contribute to the long-term growth of Cambodia.
