Ministry of Land Management: All illegal constructions in the protected area of Angkor must be removed
(Siem Reap): The Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction has announced that it will take strict and unfavorable action against all illegal constructions in the protected area of Angkor. The ministry also ordered all illegal construction owners in the Angkor resort to be removed.
