(Phnom Penh): Dr. Pen Sophal, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction and Secretary General of the National Committee for Land Management and Urban Planning, said that when talking about urbanization, one must think about natural resource management and environmental protection. Well done.
