The director of the department claimed that the cause of the fire has been reduced in recent times, while the Kovid crisis, most people do not go far from home, so when In the event of a fire, the homeowner can put out the fire himself.
Lt. Gen. Neth Vantha added that the exercise activities at Aeon Market today were an expression of active participation, as well as a demonstration of fire prevention. This exercise is not limited to Aeon Market or supermarkets, if possible, will follow all the markets in Phnom Penh.
