The reason why the factory does not pay the workers like this is because the company went bankrupt and the employer fired the workers. Heng Sour said that "the reason is that the boss declared bankruptcy and fled the workers, and the reopening or something is the relevant institutions are still investigating."
Regarding the measures to solve the problem for the workers according to Samdech Techo Hun Sen above, the spokesman confirmed that after receiving the guidance from Samdech Techo, the Minister of Labor is preparing to implement urgently to achieve completion in This week.
