(Phnom Penh): On Wednesday morning, August 17, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the graduation ceremony for a total of 623 students of the University of Puthisastra. Today's presence of Samdech Techo is the fourth time that Samdech has presented diplomas to students of the University of Puthisastra.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about 1 hour and 50 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended the Board of Directors, all professors and staff of the University of Puthisastra for their efforts to overcome the Kovid 19 crisis so that the school can continue to function.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Kovid 19 caused serious concern and affected human resource training.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that the Kovid 19 crisis has also created opportunities for the use of digital systems, especially in education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has said that for more than 100 days, Cambodia has not had any deaths due to Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that the high vaccination rate across the country has made it more resistant and prevented outbreaks.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Cambodia has kept pace with the development of digital and information technology, enabling students to study online during the Kovid 19 epidemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that civil servants who do not know information technology are not appointed to other positions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that the internet monopoly in Borey is against the competition law in Cambodia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised mobile phone companies to speed up the service network in Borey.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the Royal Government encourages competition, not encouraging the use of monopoly mechanisms.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encourages all sectors to integrate with digital systems.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended all the students who worked hard to overcome the crisis of Kovid 19 until the successful graduation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterated that Samdech Sok Chet had criticized Samdech Roeung for preparing coffins for Kovid 19 patients, but did not allow them to die without proper care.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all investors who come to invest in Cambodia always ask what is the level of Cambodia's human resources? Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that training of human resources is important and necessary.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that investment is needed both domestically and abroad and must receive the same support.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised educational institutions to pay attention to strengthening the quality of education, not just a degree without knowledge and skills. Poor quality educational institutions will collapse.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that his decision to allow the private sector to invest in education and for public schools to pay tuition fees was the right decision.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen sets December 1 as the presidency to celebrate the 10th anniversary of the presence of Minibia in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that investors do not care about democracy and even more hateful demonstrations without rules.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not abandon the demands of workers or unions that are right. Samdech Techo also instructed the Ministry of Labor to make efforts to resolve labor disputes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that replanting trees in Phnom Tamao, not just planting on Facebook, but planting them to grow and have rules. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that both zoos and forests in the entire Phnom Tamao area must be designated as conservation areas under the control of the Ministry of Agriculture.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Minister of Agriculture to find a source of water to save seedlings replanted in the dry season.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Minister of Labor and Vocational Training to resolve disputes between workers and a factory by using the national budget to pay wages.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs fraudsters to be victims of land disputes in Sihanoukville to confess.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in addition to the state system, Samdech also has many channels to monitor information and social issues.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it was a great pleasure for the ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting and related meetings in early August.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the authorities and relevant officials for their efforts in coordinating the meeting.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon and all senior officials for their efforts to facilitate and issue statements as the world was in turmoil.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the achievements are indispensable for the ability of Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon and relevant officials.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all the countries involved for creating conditions for Cambodia to contribute to solving the problem.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has stated that in September he will address the United Nations and will visit Cuba and attend Abe's funeral.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises to pay attention to curbing inflation in the market.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was more concerned about the rising price of fuel than the rising price of goods.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed hope that the Russia-Ukraine war will end soon as negotiations facilitate grain exports.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to encourage and urge to jointly fight against Kovid 19, especially to receive the vaccine in accordance with the schedule of the Ministry of Health.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ended his speech at 9:40 am on August 17, 2022, thank you for watching the live broadcast on Fresh News TV. Minister of Rural Development opens the construction site of a paved road with a length of more than 5 km in Kampong Tralach district, Kampong Chhnang province
