(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, sends a message of congratulations to His Excellency Dr. Bin Chhin, Permanent Deputy Prime Minister and Minister in Charge of the Office of the Council of Ministers, on the occasion of his 72nd birthday. August 17, 2022.
In this message, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated:
"His Excellency Honorary Doctorate Doctor
On the occasion of the success of the 72nd birthday party of His Excellency Dr. Kitti Nithikosal Bandith, who is 73 years old, my wife and I would like to wish His Excellency Kitti Nithikosal Bandith good health, strength, wisdom, and longevity.
Taking this opportunity, I would like to express my appreciation and appreciation to His Excellency Kitti Nitikosalbandit for leading the Office of the Council of Ministers for the excellent results for the Royal Government and the society. His Excellency is a leader who has sacrificed his physical, mental and mental strength to work tirelessly for the good of the nation and the people.
Once again, I would like to pray for the merits of the three jewels, all the sacred objects in the world of the guardian deities of the Kingdom of Cambodia. Madam and her family, may you be blessed with the four blessings of the Buddha: age, class, happiness, and strength.
Please, Excellency Kitti Nitikosal Bandith, be treated like a wife and me. ” The King and Princess pay homage to the late King Norodom Yuvnath
