He began his first working visit to Cambodia from 15 to 26 August 2022. During his first visit to Cambodia as the United Nations Special Rapporteur on Human Rights in Cambodia, Mr. Vitit Montaboun paid a courtesy call on Samdech Techo Hun Sen before meeting with stakeholders. Royal Government and civil society organizations.
