In order to facilitate the travel as well as the transportation of various goods of the people up and down the An Se border checkpoint easily and safely, he also requested the rubble from the company of Tycoon Try Pheap to remove the rainwater runoff. The road in front of the water has been cleared and prepared so that the water will not be damaged and the road will not be damaged again.
Mr. Chen Khanty, on behalf of the police and the people living in An Ses village, would like to express his deep gratitude to Tycoon Try Pheap Company for providing crushed stone to repair the road that was washed away by rain. Citizens.
