Mr. Ly Sary said that before her daughter disappeared at about 2 pm, she asked to buy shoes but did not tell where to buy shoes, but before allowing her mother to tell her to buy and return immediately. Coming home like this, after asking her mother, Haliza disappeared at once, but after a long absence, the phone did not ring, causing a surprise.
