Speaking on the occasion, Ms. Leang Srey Mol said that Prey Veng currently has a total of 1,168 commune councilors, 210 of whom are women, of which 371 new commune councilors, 51 of whom are female, and commune councilors. From the CPP, there are 167 people, from the Candlelight Party, a total of 202 people, and from the Khmer Love Party, 2 people.
