(Preah Vihear): The team of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Preah Vihear Province cooperated with the Choam Ksan District Authority on the morning of August 15, 2022 to cut down a fallen tree on National Road No. 62 at km. No. 188 + 400 to facilitate the traffic of the people.
