China's Eastern Military Command announced on Monday that it was conducting joint exercises in the form of reconnaissance and combat exercises at sea and air near Taiwan on Monday, and even stressed that it was a demonstration of Take a strong stand against the United States and Taiwan, which continue to play political games and undermine peace and stability in the Taiwan Straits.
