Learning is never over, we must continue to bring new knowledge, new experiences to develop ourselves, because from day to day, crime is constantly evolving and new, so we need to strengthen the capacity and understanding. In accordance with the current situation. Therefore, he advised all participants to pay attention to learn to get this knowledge and skills to apply in their practical skills.
