Book of Hope Hun Many! The author observes the characters 8 years ago with such a title
(Siem Reap): The book "Hope of Hun Many" was widely disseminated to the public as the author of this book revealed that before choosing the title "Hope of Hun Many", he tried to observe the personality, desires and vision of the characters. Taking up to 8 years. Why did the author choose this title?
In a recent forum discussion on Hun Many's book of hope held at Heritage Tech in Siem Reap, the question arose as to why author Leang de Lux used the word "hope" in the title of the book.
In response, Leang de Lux said that what had happened as a result of his latest observations came before he officially announced that he wanted to write a book about Hun Many during 2014. It was not until 2022 that Hun Many's book of hope was published for the first time.
The author of the book said, "When I look at it from 2014, it was Hun Many's visionary activities, initiatives and everything. I see this word of hope as the right word that Hun Many is very focused on. "
Leang de Lux also quotes the last sentence of the book's preface: "Hope" is an optimistic feeling that will give both physical and mental strength to move forward, continue to make achievements without discouragement. "Hope" is the national prosperity and prosperity of the people that Hun Many wants to see first. Hun Many himself must have hope to fulfill his hopes.
All readers will understand that the blood and sweat shed on Hun Many's mission as a young generation, as a politician, as a politician, as the Chairman of the Seventh Committee of the National Assembly and as the President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia. "For the nation and the people of Cambodia."
