(Kratie): The maternity ward and some other related equipment worth a total of nearly 100,000 US dollars in Snuol District Referral Hospital, Kratie Province have been put into use. Buildings and related facilities will make a significant contribution to the provision of maternity services to the people of Snuol district. This achievement has led to the welcome and applause of the people.
The inauguration ceremony of the maternity ward and related facilities was held on Sunday, August 14, 2022, presided over by Mr. Pich Bunthen, Senior Minister in charge of Special Missions, and Mr. Luc MainGuy, President of the Cambodian Solidarity Association. . The ceremony was also attended by the Director of the Provincial Health Department, the Armed Forces, village, commune authorities and residents of Snuol District Referral Hospital, Kratie Province.
Ms. Sreng Sokky, Executive Director of the Cambodian Solidarity Organization, representing the President of the Cambodian Solidarity Association, said that the construction of the maternity ward was built with the support of the Cambodian Solidarity Organization to contribute to the promotion of health in Cambodia. Core district base. In particular, contribute to ensuring better social welfare, reducing mortality rates of women and children.
Mr. Pich Bunthen thanked the Cambodian Solidarity Organization for providing both financial and material support for development in Cambodia. The generous gestures of the association show the efforts and contribution to the implementation of the fourth phase of the Rectangular Strategic Policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the Prime Minister in promoting the health sector.
On that occasion, Mr. Pich Bunthen also said that childbirth is not an easy job, which requires educating mothers to understand childbirth to avoid accidents during childbirth. In particular, pregnant women need to go to the health center regularly to get a doctor's advice, good health care and understanding of other nutrition.
Mr. Pich Bunthen also instructed the doctors and health workers working at Snuol District Referral Hospital to pay attention to provide adequate services to the people, especially the health center must have regular doctors to help people with problems. Health.
For Mr. Pich Bunthen, Snuol District Referral Hospital not only provides medical treatment and delivery services to the people, but also a place to provide opportunities for the children of the local people to learn and experience by turning this place into a training place for The next generation of young doctors who want to become doctors.
In addition to the recent cases, 30 more patients were reported dead in the last 24 hours, while another 2,576 were allowed to leave. The hospital later recovered.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Heng Sokong, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation, urged investors to participate in the development of small and medium enterprises in Cambodia to promote national economic growth, as this sector plays an important role. A sacred backbone for the development of economic growth.
Heng Sokong stated that "small and medium enterprises and handicrafts play an important role as a sacred backbone for the development of economic growth of each country, not only in Cambodia as well as in the world." .
Mr. Heng Sokong pointed out that in developed countries like Cambodia, they are very much in the development of this sector, while in the United States, which is known as a country with great progress in technology, but the enterprise sector. SMEs contribute up to 50% of GDP.
He said that in China, which is seen as the world's second largest economy after the reform of small and medium enterprises, the growth of this sector has contributed to GDP. China accounts for up to 60 percent of national economic growth.
At the same time, Mr. Heng Sokong said that in Cambodia, there are about 520,000 small and medium enterprises and micro-enterprises across the country, and as a percentage, up to about 99.7 percent of all enterprises. Across the country.
Mr. Heng Sokong said, "We should find common goals to promote the development of small and medium enterprises in Cambodia to be more successful."
In addition, Heng Sokong also promoted industrial diversification through technology transfer and investment attraction to integrate into regional and global production chains and value chains to achieve the goals of the Cambodia Vision 2030 and Year. 2050 as well.
At the same time, officials from the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation also promote and enhance the business and investment environment, including:
* Improving the quality and efficiency of the regulatory system * Promoting public-private partnerships * Continuing to promote institutional reform and expanding the implementation of decentralization programs with the sub-national level * Continuing to implement development policies Cambodia Industrial Sector 2015-2025 and strengthen the registration of small and medium enterprises and handicrafts.
The total investment capital as of the end of July 2022 was more than 15.707 million US dollars, an increase of more than 6,297 million US dollars, equivalent to 66.91% compared to the previous five years. In 2017, the total investment capital was more than 9,410 million US dollars. CPP Working Group Visits Kamchay Mear District to Disseminate the Results of the Extraordinary Central Committee Meeting
(Prey Veng): Mr. Steng Sokhom, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) and Chairman of the Kamchay Mear District Local Field Working Group, and the working group disseminated the results of the Extraordinary Meeting of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party to party members at the commune, village and Groups throughout Kamchay Mear district.
Speaking at a press conference on August 13, Mr. Steng Sokhom said that it is customary for the Cambodian People's Party to hold a meeting to review its work after each election to find out the strengths and weaknesses, find the reasons and Results of the last Commune / Sangkat Council Election of the 5th Mandate and discussed the goals to complement the victory in the upcoming 2023 National Assembly Election.
Mr. Steng Sokhom highlighted that the main factors that make the CPP Kamchay Mear district successful is based on three bases:
First, the factors of good leadership from the top leadership with a system of systematic leadership, guidelines, policies, strategies, specific work programs.
Second: Strong leadership, outstanding leadership, outstanding leadership of the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party, both the President of the party, both the President and the Vice President. Especially in Prey Veng province, Samdech Krala Hom and his wife are virtuous and capable leaders and have a specific way of working.
Third, officials from all levels to the grassroots, good officials, capable, active officials, popular, well-connected and officials who dare to donate both physical and mental resources for the party.
Fourth, the factor of people's participation and the people of Kamchay Mear district are good, they see the good deeds of the party leaders, see the good deeds of the party, see the important achievements that the CPP leads the Royal Government. This made them give the truth and the truth of the election to the CPP, make the CPP continue to win the election, in fact, our Kamchay Mear district continues to win the election, praise from the leadership.
On that occasion, the Chairman of the Working Group also mentioned the current situation to inform party members, starting from the epidemic of Kovid 19. Mr. Steng Sokhom said that although Cambodia is relaxed about Kovid 19, but the world is not relaxed yet.
At this point, Mr. Steng Sokhom suggested that party members and working groups should increase the vaccination to all doses and continue to increase the dose according to the schedule to be vaccinated. At the same time, he also advised all party members to continue to implement "three protection measures" on a regular basis.
Mr. Steng Sokhom continued, "Due to the good management of 19 Kovid, Cambodia has achieved results in holding constitutional elections every five years, commune council elections and general elections." "In fact, the recent commune council elections were successful without raising the risk of spreading Kovid 19."
"This event has given us two victories at the same time: victory as the ruling party to make this election run smoothly and successfully, and secondly, the victory of the party," he said. "The Cambodian people are in the race for the election, which is a source of pride for our party."
Mr. Steng Sokhom also pointed out that the most important success is that the Royal Government has managed macroeconomic stability better. He explained that although Cambodia as well as the world are facing Kovid-19 and the Russia-Ukraine war, the Royal Government has managed and maintained macroeconomic stability, curbed inflation, maintained the purchasing power of the riel, and continued to maintain savings. High to cope with the situation that is happening.
He said that if the government does not manage macroeconomic stability well, the country will face unrest, insecurity and people face food shortages. These are all great achievements that the party has achieved, which has made people more confident in the leadership of the CPP and voted for the CPP.
Regarding the recent amendments to the Constitution, Mr. Steng Sokhom explained in detail the purpose of filling in the gaps of the Constitution, and this amendment is also in the national interest.
Mr. Steng Sokhom also requested the members to continue to push for in-depth reforms at all sites with a strong will through mirroring, bathing, scrubbing, treatment and surgery approaches, which is an important point to support and implement well. Another important point is to implement the policy of safe villages and communes, because it is very important for the CPP to lead at the grassroots level.
Regarding the promotion of commune / sangkat policy development 2022-2027, the Chairman of Kamchay Mear District Working Group requested all 8 communes of the district to make this plan as soon as possible. First, the preparation of new internal regulations and second: planning the development of communes in accordance with the policies of the party raised before the election.
He also noted the strengthening of local administrations to implement their roles, duties and working procedures, especially to strengthen local post officers, including commune chiefs, post chiefs and clerks, to gain the trust of the people. At this point, he confirmed that the party leaders have decided to dare to change any officials who do not serve the people well.
On this occasion, Mr. Steng Sokhom requested the district party presidents, presidents of the eight commune parties in Kamchay Mear district to pay attention to encourage young people in the families of party members of voting age to register to vote on time and in large numbers. . He said that when they register more, it will increase the number of party members and increase the number of votes for the CPP.
Mr. Steng Sokhom also encouraged the building of more party members, stating that building the party is an important task that must be done regularly, there is no word on leave, even on election day, still build the next party members Elections also build party members, build party members non-stop.
He explained, "The party is like the human body, so the old cells fall to the new cells. "The strength of the Cambodian People's Party is to build the party itself, and the work of building the party has two major problems, expand the party members and strengthen existing members."
He said that the party can be built and the quality of party members must be strengthened if they are on the list of party members and ask for both names, people, both physically and mentally, and have a sincere respect for the party.
Finally, Mr. Steng Sokhom noted that maintaining strong internal unity within the party, which from the top to the grassroots, is very important to push to the grassroots to the commune, village and party.
