(Phnom Penh): General Dr. Neth Savoeun, General Commissioner of the National Police, has agreed in principle for the Department of Private Security Management to hold a refresher course on the Criminal Code, Criminal Procedure Code and Investigative Measures to strengthen the capacity and quality of officers to be professional and competent. Full time to perform tasks effectively.
