In the message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated as follows:
On the occasion of the celebration of the 69th birthday of Lok Chumteav, 70 years old, my wife and I would like to wish Her Excellency Serey Vathana Vibol Sok good health, strength, wisdom, and a long life.
I would like to express my appreciation and appreciation to Lok Chumteav for her great contribution to the cause of serving the nation. Lok Chumteav is a leader who is full of virtue and a good example of heroism and always strives to promote women's rights, protect the national identity, traditions, customs and culture and participate in all activities in the service of national interests and the well-being of the people.
Once again, I would like to pray for the merits of the three jewels, all the sacred objects in the Deity of the Preservation of the Territory of the Kingdom of Cambodia. Sons, daughters, grandsons, granddaughters, may all be blessed with the four blessings of the Buddha: age, class, happiness, and strength.
