Commentary: China's story needs to be decided by the Chinese people themselves
BEIJING, July 10 (Xinhua) - China has released a statement on July 10 entitled "China's story needs to be decided by the Chinese people themselves." The harsh words clearly show that the Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs related to China's core interests and the Chinese people's national sentiments do not allow any outside force to interfere.
China's publication of the White Paper is not only a strong response to Pelosi's visit to Taiwan, but also outlines China's overall strategy for resolving the Taiwan issue in the new era. Add momentum to prosperity and stability in the Asia-Pacific region to the rest of the world.
The White Paper first outlines the future of achieving bilateral unification on the principle of a country with two systems of governance, including a broader Taiwan development gap. Fully guaranteed, jointly promote the prosperity and prosperity of the Chinese nation and contribute to peace and progress of the Asia-Pacific region to the whole world.
China's affairs need to be decided by the Chinese people themselves. China will surely fulfill the historic task of unification if those who play the "US-dependent Taiwan independence" and "prevent China by using Taiwan as an excuse" can not see the historical trend. To be clear, you should read this white book well and learn history lessons again.
