(Preah Vihear): After assuming the position of Governor of Preah Vihear, Mr. Kim Rithy, Provincial Governor, in recent days, has been busy visiting government officials and the Armed Forces at various destinations to encourage and support the defense. Security, order and territorial integrity with neighboring countries.
In fact, on August 10, 2022, he visited and talked with the Preah Vihear Military Operations Area Unit and the Preah Vihear Provincial Gendarmerie. On that occasion, Mr. Kim Rithy made a strong commitment on behalf of the provincial administration, on behalf of the civil servants of the three Armed Forces of Preah Vihear Province, to declare support for the candidacy of Dr. Hun Manet as the next leader of Cambodia.
Mr. Kim Rithy reminded and informed the leadership of the Armed Forces that Dr. Hun Manet, the Commander of the Army, is a Cambodian child with a patriotic attitude and loved the military from an early age. He worked hard until he graduated from the United States Military Academy and went on to study in the UK, earning a series of doctorates in economics, according to his work history.
The Governor of Preah Vihear Province said that Dr. Hun Manet has a lot of knowledge, military work, he talked about economic work, he talked about international diplomacy, he talked about land issues, he talked about his long-term vision. In all of these and other matters. Due to all these factors of Dr. Hun Manet, the meeting of the Cambodian People's Party unanimously decided to elect a candidate for the post of Prime Minister of Cambodia.
Therefore, on behalf of the new provincial administration, on behalf of the new provincial governor, Mr. Kim Rithy announced that all armed forces would agree with him through a message from the Preah Vihear Provincial Military Operations Area "committed to supporting Dr. Hun Manet as the next leader. The turn of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Mr. Kim Rithy also stated that on behalf of the Governor of Preah Vihear Provincial Board of Governors, on behalf of the Provincial Unity Command, he would like to support the armed forces along the border, especially the Preah Vihear Provincial Military Operations Area Command. The territorial integrity protects the territory of Cambodia with an area of 181,035 square kilometers and especially the border in Preah Vihear province not to lose 1 mm.
At the same time, the provincial governor also instructed the armed forces to:
* Participate in defending the Constitution, defending the King, defending the Royal Government born from the election * Participating in defending the peace * Do not do what the law prohibits and commit crimes * Pay attention to the work of veterans, especially veterans with land Homeless, homeless, and destitute * Avoid the drug problem * Prevent Kovid by implementing the "3 do not and 3 prevent" measures * There must be good solidarity, there must be mutual understanding and tolerance.
