Preah Sihanouk Provincial Court issues statement on arrest of former Chin Ra player in connection with case of human detention and illegal possession of weapons
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Court has issued a statement clarifying the posting of information regarding the arrest of Chin Ra. He was arrested in connection with a case of illegal detention and detention at a hotel on April 21, 2022.
In a statement obtained by Fresh News this morning, August 11, 2022, a spokesman for the Sihanoukville Provincial Court stated:
In order to avoid confusion over the actions involved in the above case, the spokesperson of Sihanoukville Provincial Court is honored to clarify and inform the public and all media as follows:
* First, Chin Phea Rieng, alias Chin Ra, was arrested in connection with the illegal detention and detention of a person at a hotel, where Chin Phea Rieng, alias Jin Ra, was working as a security guard. Involved in the training of Khmer martial arts by Chin Ra.
According to the report of the Sihanoukville Provincial Police, on April 21, 2022, at around 10:00 AM, the Sihanoukville Provincial Unity Command together with the specialized police force searched the Jing Hotel. The bumper was found to have a room on the second floor, a room for illegal detainees.
During the interrogation phase, the Investigating Judge of the Preah Sihanouk Provincial Court ordered the detention of the five accused and completed their proceedings by summoning the accused for questioning, summoning the victims, The witness will have already sent a letter of closure to the prosecutor's office. Meanwhile, in this case to date, no accused has been released on bail.
* Third: Once again, the spokesperson of the Sihanoukville Provincial Court would like to emphasize that the arrest of Chin Phea Rieng alias Chin Ra is related to the illegal detention and detention of people and the possession of weapons without permission. It is a criminal offense that this case is not related to the training of this person in Khmer martial arts, as published by some media and Youtube pages.
In this case, the court and the prosecutor of the Sihanoukville Provincial Court will carefully and accurately investigate to find out the truth in accordance with the law and procedures in force.
