Mr. Leang De Lux said that before writing this book, Hun Many hoped that he would follow the work activities of Hun Many's character, but Mr. Hun Many did not know that he was following him. It was only in 2019 that he decided to write this book. He admits that the book is a journalistic description because of his many years of experience in the field of journalism.
Leang de Lux said that although the art of writing, the content of this book is focused on practical activities, visions to the future of the characters in the book, he used the word "hope" in the title.
Mr. Leang de Lux also wants the younger generation to turn to reading books and try to quote good points, good examples of characters in the book to apply in life, especially to cultivate national consciousness as a force to build a society. .
Hun Many, the protagonist of the book, stated that he never suppressed the right to write Leang De Lux because he learned more about himself, and he hoped that through this book, he would share the spirit of pursuing a love conscience. Nation to youth.
Mr. Hun Many claimed that the story in this book does not come from just writing, but from biography, study history, work history, will, action and vision for the future. "Work, activities, will and vision for the nation are done by the father," he said.
Please be informed that Hun Many's book of hope is more than 250 pages long and consists of 4 chapters. The first edition was 10,000 copies.
