Dr. Ith Sam Heng stated that even recently, the crisis of Kovid-19, which has caused great crisis to public health, society and economy, the Vietnamese government has taken prompt, responsible, timely and effective measures. Contribute globally to the prevention of this epidemic by supporting and providing assistance to the international community as well as Cambodia in both bilateral and multilateral frameworks.
He also wished the traditional solidarity, friendship and all-round cooperation between the ruling party and the people of our two countries to grow stronger and stronger.
