In his condolence message, Samdech Techo Hun Sen highlighted the overwhelming sadness and grief over the death of the great disciple Kosal Chetta, a Buddhist supporter of Pen Yut, the mother-in-law and birth mother of Khieu Kanharith and Tep Rainsy.
