Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers the death of the great disciple Kosal Chetta, a Buddhist supporter of Pen Yut, to be the loss of his mother, mother-in-law, great-grandmother, great-great-grandfather to his children and grandchildren, and throughout his life, the great disciple has struggled to give up his physical and mental strength. Resources and wisdom to promote the field of Buddhism in Cambodia to grow more in the past.
Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit would like to dedicate their prayers to the soul of the great disciple Kosal Chetta, a Buddhist supporter of Pen Yut.
