(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police under the direct command of Major General Chuon Narin, Provincial Police Commissioner, launched an operation to crack down on the shooting death of a Chinese national and seriously injuring three Chinese nationals. People also died.
According to the report of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police, obtained by Fresh News this evening, it was confirmed that on August 9, 2022, at 00:50 AM in front of Hotel 520 in Village 6, Sangkat 4 Sihanoukville: There was an explosion caused by a group of six people, including: a Cambodian driver and five Chinese friends.
Another victim, who was riding in the front, was arrested by three suspects and taken away with the victim's car as a means of escaping.
At the above point, the suspect's car, driving at high speed, swerved and hit the light pole, while the police surrounded the car, causing several explosions and rescuing one victim (by him Crawled out of the car, raised his hand to the side of the car with his hands in handcuffs and arrested three suspects).
Victims and Suspects Seriously Injured Police sent one victim and one suspect to the Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital, while two other suspects died on the spot and one suspect was taken to the Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital. He died at the hospital.
In total, there were 3 victims:
* Three suspects were Chinese nationals. All three died: two died (at the scene when fleeing) and one died (sent from the scene at the time of escape to Preah Referral Hospital). Sihanouk).
