Mr. Ny Phally informed the meeting that under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in launching a successful policy of vaccinating Kovid-19 to people across the country, increase community awareness and lead to Reopen the country in all areas, including tourism.
This is why Cambodia has been selected to host the General Assembly of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the World to be held in Sihanoukville during December 2022. Will the Sea Festival.
At the same time, in order to be more ready to organize the above two big events, Mr. Ny Phally highly appreciated and instructed the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration, which has various departments and specialized units, to continue its more active efforts. Disseminate education and prepare some work:
First. Continue to promote and promote a clean city, including major tourist destinations and all beaches in Sihanoukville.
Second. Continue to strengthen the provision of quality and warm tourism services and tourism products.
Third. Encourage tourism businesses to implement tourism safety rules and minimum operating standards (SOPs) and health measures consistently to enhance the prestige of Sihanoukville as a safe tourism destination.
Fourth. Strengthen the quality and safety of tourist transport services, both inland and inland.
Fifth. Promote and encourage all tourism businesses to support and use local products such as vegetables, fruits, meat and other products.
Sixth. Increase the opening of training courses to develop human resources in the tourism sector to ensure the provision of quality services and good hospitality.
7th. Promote the organization of many events, including tourism, sports and tourism exhibition events.
8th. Organize affordable tour packages from accommodation, food and travel to attract more tourists to Sihanoukville.
9th. Participate in promoting tourism destinations in Sihanoukville, starting from local people, relevant departments to the provincial administration.
10th. Request the Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration, relevant departments and units to visit all business locations to grasp the challenges and find practical solutions and, if necessary, to request technical assistance from the relevant ministries to ensure the sustainability of tourism development. And to promote local economic growth.
It should be noted that according to the letter No. 214 SORN dated March 28, 2022 of the Office of the Council of Ministers, the Royal Government decided in principle to set the date for the 9th Sea Festival Round 3 in Sihanoukville from the 9th. December 11, 2022 and the convention of the most beautiful beach club in the world from December 9 to 14, 2022.
