Kambol police arrest man over 50 for seducing 10-year-old girl four times
(Phnom Penh): Police in Kambol district arrested a 53-year-old man after seducing a 10-year-old girl and raping her four times. Only once.
The incident last happened at 12 noon on August 5, 2022 at the land of Wat Ang, Kampong Thmor Keo, Ang village, Sangkat Preah Lang, Phnom Penh.
Police said that the suspect, 53-year-old Mam Sros, a worker in a concrete company, lived in a house with no house number in Ang village, Preah Lang commune, Kambol district, while the 10-year-old victim lived in the same village.
The last time the lustful man rode a motorbike from the house to the victim girl when he arrived home and found her sitting alone in the house. He then asked her to go to the rice field, telling her to change the mosquito net and put the fish. Decided.
The suspect then told the girl not to tell her parents and withdrew 2,000 riel from the pocket and earrings of a beer can with a prize for the girl, then drove her home. When she got home, she did not dare to tell her parents, but due to suspicion, her parents asked for help and the story of the man was raped.
Then, on August 6, 2022, the parents brought their daughter to file a lawsuit. Police arrested the suspect and took him for questioning and to build a case to send to court.
