* First: The design of the gate must confirm the Khmer national identity, the gate size is 16 meters wide, 12 meters high and highlighted by creative ideas that reflect the marine resources, biodiversity and development of Sihanoukville, decorated with lights, modern and simple design. With the content confirming the meaning of this gate model.
