The Minister considered the banking and financial sector to be the heart of the country's economy, so as the banking and financial sector grows, so does the economic sector.
Minister Khieu Kanharith praised the Banking Association of Cambodia, the Cambodian Microfinance Association and the Club of Cambodian Journalists for organizing an awareness training course on banking and finance, as well as organizing a competition for the award. Banking and financial institutions to improve the lives of Cambodians.
"I urge the Banking Association of Cambodia and the Microfinance Association to continue to promote the financial literacy of journalists to journalists, and to our journalists the most important basis of financial banking is the confidence to seek," he said. "Clear sources of information to ensure emotional stability for the people, financial stability and banking in our country."
