Mr. Rath Sophoan, Vice President of the Banking Association of Cambodia, said that according to the report of the National Bank of Cambodia, the banking sector continues to maintain its resilience and has contributed to the recovery of economic activity. At the same time, Cambodians have confidence in the banking system, which is reflected in:
