In response, Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Mr. Bilaval Butozadari for attending the 55th ASEAN Ministerial Meeting and related meetings in Phnom Penh. Samdech Techo stated that the meeting was at a time of great controversy, such as the case in Myanmar, the case of the South China Sea, the case of the war in Ukraine, etc. However, we worked together until Success.
