Once these procedures have been completed, the post-amendment Constitution will be the foundation for the nation to ensure the protection of the national interests of the nation and the people of Cambodia, as well as the Cambodian people and all political parties elected by the people. Cambodians will benefit from the smooth and sustainable operation of the nation's top institutions, especially the executive branch, which has the mission of leading the nation's general work.
