In order to participate in the effective implementation of the law on road traffic, the Ministry would like to advise motorists traveling on the road to have the following documents, including:
1: Driver's license requires the use of original documents.
2: Vehicle identification card can use photocopied documents. In case the vehicle identification card does not have a QR Code, it needs to be certified by the competent authority on the copy before it can be used officially.
3: Certificate of technical inspection of the vehicle (check) can use a copy of the document.
4: For vehicles engaged in the business of transporting goods or passengers, must be accompanied by an additional permit for the vehicle for transport business can use a copy of the document.
