Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Occasion of Receiving an Honorary Doctorate in Development from the Royal University of Phnom Penh
(Phnom Penh): On Friday morning, August 5, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, received an Honorary Doctorate in Development from the University of Phnom Penh.
The graduation ceremony was held on the occasion of Samdech Techo's 70th and 71st birthday. Samdech Techo was born on Tuesday, August 15, 1952.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than 1 hour and 30 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his deep gratitude to the Royal University of Phnom Penh for awarding him an honorary doctorate in development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is a lifelong learner, as long as he lives, he will learn forever.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises children who always listen to Samdech's advice to make Samdech a good father
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked his enemies for their efforts and gave him the opportunity to be careful and find ways to protect themselves and the lives of the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the King and Samdech Mey for blessing Samdech on his birthday
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the leaders, civil servants, the Armed Forces and the people for sending a message of congratulations to Samdech
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reason we can organize the ASEAN Summit directly is due to security, peace and political stability.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said not to lose peace, but to strive for peace
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the second factor is the control of 19 Kovid, which led to the reopening of the country
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are four factors that pushed Cambodia to join ASEAN in 1999
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reveals that while the world is in conflict, even arranging seats for foreign ministers for the ASEAN summit is difficult because some do not want to sit close to each other
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen seeks understanding from the people of Phnom Penh due to some roadblocks for the delegation to attend the ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting in Cambodia
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the ASEAN Presidential Meeting, Cambodia had ambitions to become an RCEP Secretariat in Phnom Penh.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen responds to critics who say he is ignorant, stating that if he is ignorant, he will not be able to stand for 45 years and be the Prime Minister for 43 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that now Samdech is the father, the next day Samdech will become the grandfather of Dr. and now Samdech is the Prime Minister and the next day Samdech will become the Prime Minister again
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that last time, Samdech did not want his children to enter politics to join the army, but now Samdech urges all his children to enter politics
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that in the current amendment, the National Assembly has not lost any role
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that although the Prime Minister is appointed by the King, in order for the entire Council of Ministers to pass through the National Assembly, a vote of confidence is required.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen responds to critics that Samdech prepares his children to take turns, stating that Samdech did not train his children to be thieves
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that I adjusted my birthday so that my children would know my real birthday
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that students are in the priority group to be vaccinated like doctors, civil servants and the armed forces
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen claims that currently, every month, the Royal Government must continue to spend $ 40 million to help people affected by Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded the Secretary of State of the United States and the European Union to consider sanctions against Russia, which make it difficult for all, including Europe itself.
