(Kampong Thom): Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, on August 4, 2022, led a working group to inspect the land situation in 3 areas in Bek Chan area, Pak Thep area and Phnom Chimos area, Chamnar Krom commune, Stong district, Kampong Thom province. Citizens have the right to enjoy rice normally and issue title deeds (land titles) to citizens as well.
On that occasion, Mr. Nguon Rattanak thanked the people who joined the authorities, especially with the Royal Government, by confiscating land in three areas and also strictly prohibited the use in the past, but now Samdech Techo gave a joint working group. The national and provincial levels have studied in detail how to clear land from area 3 to area 2 so that people have sufficient rights to enjoy rice normally and issue title deeds (land titles) to people as well.
