</ p </ p The Senate will convene tomorrow morning to review and comment on the draft law on constitutional amendments.
(Phnom Penh): The Senate of Cambodia will hold a session on August 5, 2022, 2022 tomorrow to review and comment on the draft law on the amendment of the Constitution and the Constitution.
This session will be chaired by Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate with the following agenda:
First, listen to the report of the Standing Committee on the activities and results of the Senate between the 8th and 9th sessions of the 4th legislature.
Second: Review and comment on the draft Constitution on the amendment of Article 19 (new), Article 89, Article 98 new, Article 102 new, Article 119 new (one) and Article 125 new of the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia and Article 3 new and Article The new 4 additional constitutional laws aim to ensure the normal functioning of national institutions.
Third, review and comment on the draft law on non-tax revenue management.
And 5: Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the Kingdom of Cambodia to be a party to the Convention on Assistance in the event of a nuclear disaster or radiation disaster.
