(Kampong Thom): The family of 75-year-old Leang in Kampong Kdei village, Kampong Chen Tbong commune, Stong district, Kampong Thom province, has urged the Supreme Court President Dith Monty to intervene and seek justice after her adopted daughter, Leang Pong Heang The 38-year-old encroached on a plot of land measuring 5 meters by 17 meters by filing a lawsuit from Kampong Thom Provincial Court to the Court of Appeal and then to the Supreme Court in 2017.
The case of the adopted daughter who took over her mother's land and lived there lasted for 5 years until she passed away on June 3, 2022 after she and her younger brother, Mr. Leang Tha filed a re-appeal to the President of the Supreme Court on May 30, 2022.
The complaint of the body of Mrs. Leang and her brother Leang Tha, 63 years old, has been submitted to the President of the Supreme Court for the past two months, but has not yet received information and results from the President of the Supreme Court. No, not at all.
Mr. Leang Tha, who is the younger brother of Ms. Leang's body, added that in fact, this plot of land is his sister will give to her adopted daughter because he does not have children and take the name. Leang Pong Heang has been adopted since she was 3-4 years old, but her adopted daughter stole a complaint to the court by falsifying some documents until she won the case and has been in possession of it until now.
Leang Tha and her brother Leang Tha then appealed to the Court of Appeal. On February 13, 2019, the Court of Appeal ruled in favor of the mother and brother, rejecting the daughter's claim and the decision of the Kampong Thom Provincial Court.
After that, the adopted daughter appealed to the Supreme Court, but on November 8, 2019, the Supreme Court ruled in favor of the adopted daughter, following the verdict of the Kampong Thom Provincial Court and decided to return the case to the Court of Appeal. Reopen the trial. Following the reopening of the trial on September 29, 2020, the Court of Appeal ruled in favor of the adoptive mother and younger brother, rejecting the daughter's claim.
After that, the adopted daughter continued to appeal to the Supreme Court again, until September 6, 2021, the court issued a verdict for the adopted daughter to win the case again and rejected the judgment of the Court of Appeal. Then, on November 5, 2021, Leang Tha's adoptive mother and brother Leang Tha appealed to the Supreme Court again and were rejected by the Supreme Court.
On May 30, 2022, the bodies of Ms. Leang and Mr. Leang Tha also applied to the President of the Supreme Court for a retrial, but until August 1, 2022, the family of The body has not yet received the information and the result of the decision of the President of the Supreme Court, so the family of the body asked Mr. Dith Monty to help investigate and give justice to the body of Ms. Leang with favor.
